          "headers": [
            {
              "cell": "A1",
              "text": "Supplemental Data table 1: Differentially expressed genes in Founder 1 cells compare to other founders. Differential expression calculated using the Seurat FindMarkers() function. Statistics generated with two-sided wilcoxon tests, adjusted p-values are Bonferroni corrected based on the total number of genes in the dataset. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
