          },
          "headers": [
            {
              "cell": "A1",
              "text": "Supplemental Data table 5: Cell counts of treatment na\u00efve HL60 cells clustering with AraC resistant cells"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Supplemental Data  6",
          "dimension": {
            "ref": "A1:G1799"
          },
          "headers": [
            {
              "cell": "A1",
              "text": "Supplemental Data table 6: C1498 gene modules generated by Hotspot. Module membership designated in the Module column, with -1 indicating autocorrelation without module membership. Clone column indicates which lineage tree used for module generation. Values displayed include scaled 1:1 autocorrelation coefficients, autocorrelation Z-scores, P-values computed from Z-scores, and FDR Q-values using BH correction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Supplemental Data  7",
          "dimension": {
            "ref": "A1:Z5458"
          },
          "headers": [
            {
              "cell": "A1",
              "text": "Supplemental Data table 7: HL60 gene modules generated by Hotspot. Module membership designated in the Module column, with -1 indicating autocorrelation without module membership. Clone column indicates which lineage tree used for module generation. Values displayed include scaled 1:1 autocorrelation coefficients, autocorrelation Z-scores, P-values computed from Z-scores, and FDR Q-values using BH correction. H_META is the population-wide HL60 tree. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Supplemental Data  8",
          "dimension": {
            "ref": "A1:AB1002"
          },
          "headers": [
            {
              "cell": "A1",
              "text": "Supplemental Data table 8: Multivariate cox proportional hazard models for C1498 and HL60 Hotspot modules. Adjusted for age at diagnosis and sex (3 degrees of freedom). Two-sided log-rank P-values and 95% confidence intervals are shown for each variable. P values adjusted with BH correction. "
            }
          ]
        },
